      <activity id="5b6950fe-455c-5306-a34e-10d5141368fb" activityNameId="6207409b-91fc-5327-b0cd-fb2f21ae3de8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump, brine-water, 10kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump, brine-water, 10kW
Average infrastructure of a 10 kW brain-water heat pump.;
UUID: c6b012a1-9b92-31c2-8ad2-deab5c0befcb
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials, energy and water needed for production. It includes emissions of refrigerant (R134a) during production and scrapping. It does not include emissions during operation. It does not include the borehole heat exchanger. A buffer heat storage is not included.
Location: Could be used for European conditions.
Technology: Brine-water heat pump, 10kW output. Refrigerant R134a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c6b012a1-9b92-31c2-8ad2-deab5c0befcb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
